  "body_html": "<h1>Support Of A Mixed Strategy</h1>\n<p>The support of a mixed strategy $x \\in \\Delta(I)$ is the set\n$$\n  \\operatorname{supp}(x)=\\{i \\in I : x_i&gt;0\\}.\n$$\nIn Lean, <code>MatrixGame.support</code> returns this as a <code>Finset I</code> via\n<code>Finset.univ.filter (0 &lt; x.val ·)</code>. Marked <code>noncomputable</code> because strict\ninequality on <code>ℝ</code> is not decidable.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MFoGT, Chapter 2, Section 2.3] Laraki, Renault, and Sorin, <em>Mathematical Foundations of Game Theory</em>, <code>references/MathFoundationsGameTheory.pdf</code>. Support of a mixed strategy.</li>\n</ul>",
